"text": "The block runs the formatter and the linter; the root binaries' units and the filtered new cases (0 on the untouched tree, read red-vacuous at baseline); the new integration binary by its cases' prefix; the readers of the moved literals and tables; the rehearsal of R3 over the fakes; the host read; the harness's three layers; then the operator pass."
},
{
"from": 237,
"to": 241,
"text": "**What is not run, and why:** no round entry — R3 is the operator's act, fired once on his word through the `operator` entry below, never by implement (`inputs#I2`). No boot smoke: no boot-path file changes (`src/cmd/run.rs` and `src/run/` are untouched, research §Files to modify). No mutation run (`inputs#I1` item 9). No fuzz target: no new parser — the clients reply goes through the seam's existing parse. No `cargo deny`: no dependency edge moves (research §Graph impact, crate_edges)."
},
{
"from": 243,
"to": 246,
"text": "**Must-pass readings owed to implement:** entries 8 and 19 assert literals step 15's script prints. Entry 8, fired once the script exists and before any graded use, is the reading of both: its rehearsal prints the live verdict line. Entry 19's record, `evidence/r3.md`, is written by the operator from R3's output (step 16), a step outside this block; entry 13 reads it and carries no `artifact`."
},
{
"from": 248,
"to": 250,
"text": "**The remove-the-guard controls** are implement's one-shot `gate.py control` runs, never entries. Each is fired on the `ctl-root` entry, its case named, `--timeout 900`; each case fails on its own bounded assertion, so a `timeout` reading would NOT read the guard as held."
},
{
"from": 252,
"to": 256,
"text": "| id | File | The edit removes | Case | Entry | |---|---|---|---|---| | `focus-reuse` | `src/cmd/focus.rs` | the `chain` membership test on the recorded arm of `client_of` | `focus_client_skips_a_recorded_address_outside_the_ancestry` | `ctl-root` | | `focus-order` | `src/cmd/focus.rs` | the `Workspace` dispatch before `FocusWindow` | `focus_dispatches_the_workspace_then_the_window` | `ctl-root` | | `focus-no-client` | `src/cmd/focus.rs` | the early return on no client | `focus_with_no_client_is_window_not_found_and_dispatches_nothing` | `ctl-root` |"
}
],
